  "W >= 12 (n=5)": "Each source is touched an even number of times, so W is even and W >= 2n = 10. W = 10 forces k <= 10 and leaves only the all-unit k=10 words (the frozen 945 pairings, max coverage 31) or k <= 9 words, which need s <= 9 covers that do not exist. Hence W >= 12.",
